      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the loft one is okay but maybe a bit too \"busy\" sounding. i want to make sure we're hitting the right notes for our specific buyer profiles. \n\nfor the oak ridge estate, can you make it sound even more prestigious? focus more on the sense of tradition, heritage, and the \"old money\" feel of the area. \n\nand for the loft, can you lean into the \"up-and-coming\" vibe? maybe mention how the neighborhood is changing and attracting a more diverse, trendy crowd. it's a great selling point for investors looking at the area's growth.",
